Output docs/media/commit.gif
Set Shell zsh
Set FontFamily "Menlo"
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1640
Set Height 820
Set Padding 14
Set Margin 22
Set MarginFill "#11111b"
Set WindowBar Colorful
Set WindowBarSize 36
Set BorderRadius 12
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Set Framerate 24
Env COLORTERM truecolor
Env GITPAD_LOGO text
Hide
Type 'cd "$GITPAD_DEMO" && clear && gitpad' Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Show
Sleep 800ms
Type "c"
Sleep 1.2s
Down@300ms 2
Enter
Sleep 600ms
Type "3"
Sleep 800ms
Space
Sleep 800ms
Screenshot docs/screenshots/commit.png
Type "2"
Sleep 300ms
Type "feat(search): debounce suggestions on the client"
Sleep 1s
Ctrl+S
Sleep 2.5s
